      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "On that same note.\nConsider also adding an email confirmation when accessing from a different device, you know, like some sort of code sent to the email address that would then be confirmed by the owner of said account.\nSince accessing accounts without 2FA still poses a threat to the account, even without changing the password.",
      "viewerReactions": null
